"""TenSeiAi "common questions" pack - the questions people ask AI assistants most.

Grounded in 2025-2026 usage research: writing/improving text, brainstorming,
summarising, explaining things simply, everyday how-to, life advice, money,
health basics, study, travel/food and technology/AI questions.

Everything is stored as memory passages (so retrieval + the language model
learn from it) and as verified Q&A pairs (teacher://common-pack) so direct
questions hit instantly.

Usage:
    python tools/seed_common_pack.py            # add data
    python tools/seed_common_pack.py --train    # add data + retrain the brain
"""
